    <string name="fork_cells_help_rule_short">Rest under 15 minutes and charging in progress — no verdict.</string>
    <string name="fork_cells_help_rule_prelim">Rest 15–60 minutes — a “preliminary” verdict, never red.</string>
    <string name="fork_cells_help_rule_cold">Cold: battery below 10 °C — thresholds × 2, never red, measure again when warm.</string>
    <string name="fork_cells_help_rule_once">“Service” — only when the spread is confirmed by a second measurement on another day.</string>
    <string name="fork_cells_help_rule_median">The reference point is the median of the 184 cells: one weak cell does not move it. “Noticeably” — a deviation above half the zone norm, “much” — above half the “service” threshold.</string>
